#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:8
msgid "编写、翻译和验证文档"
msgstr "Write, translate and validate documentation"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:10
msgid ""
"每页只维护一份权威正文。先确定读者要完成的事，再选择教程、任务指南、参考或 "
"原理解释。内容与图示规范见[文档标准](../reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md) "
"和[页面模板](../reference/contracts/documentation-templates.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Maintain one authoritative body per page. First identify what the reader "
"needs to accomplish, then select a tutorial, task guide, reference or "
"explanation. Content and diagram rules are in the [documentation "
"standard](../reference/contracts/documentation-standards.md) and [page "
"templates](../reference/contracts/documentation-templates.md)."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:14
msgid "编写正文"
msgstr "Write the body"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:16
msgid ""
"开头说明结果、前提和适用范围。命令写明工作目录、所需工具、完整输入、预期输出 及失败处理。当前实现、目标设计、软件参考和实际执行分别表达；历史记录用固定"
" 源码链接读取，不把旧计数写进当前操作步骤。"
msgstr ""
"Start with the result, prerequisites and applicable scope. Commands state "
"the working directory, required tools, complete inputs, expected output and "
"failure handling. Distinguish current implementation, target design, "
"software references and actual execution. Read historical records through "
"fixed source links; do not put old counts into current operating steps."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:20
msgid ""
"每页 front matter 明确 `id`、`type`、`audience`、`source_language`。新教程引用维护的 真实 "
"fixture 或固定外部消费者；源码拥有的输入优先 literalinclude，片段说明缺少 什么。普通文档构建不执行任意 Markdown "
"命令、不获取 latest、不操作硬件。"
msgstr ""
"Every page explicitly declares `id`, `type`, `audience` and "
"`source_language` in front matter. New tutorials reference maintained real "
"fixtures or pinned external consumers. Prefer literalinclude for source-"
"owned inputs, and state what a fragment omits. Ordinary documentation builds"
" do not execute arbitrary Markdown commands, fetch latest source or operate "
"hardware."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:24
msgid ""
"图示有明确范围、图注、替代文字和箭头语义。修改编辑源后更新本地 SVG，并检查 "
"文字、交叉线、窄屏、缩放及离线显示。绘制流程见[图示参考](../reference/diagrams.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Diagrams have explicit scope, captions, alternative text and arrow "
"semantics. After editing the source, update the local SVG and inspect text, "
"crossings, narrow screens, zoom and offline display. See the [diagram "
"reference](../reference/diagrams.md) for the authoring process."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:27
msgid "准备工具与预览"
msgstr "Prepare tools and preview"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:29
msgid ""
"正文根是 `docs/`，`docs/sphinx/` 只维护配置和模板。按 [工具参考](../reference/documentation-"
"tools.md)显式准备一次锁定工具，然后从仓库根执行："
msgstr ""
"The prose root is `docs/`; `docs/sphinx/` maintains only configuration and "
"templates. Explicitly prepare the pinned tools once using the [tool "
"reference](../reference/documentation-tools.md), then run from the "
"repository root:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:41
msgid ""
"预览为日常写作提供实际语言状态，不充当完整双语验收。commit 检查只检查完整 staged 文档输入及需要的配置，既不联网安装工具，也不自动 "
"stage 修复。"
msgstr ""
"Preview reports actual language status for daily writing; it does not "
"qualify complete bilingual documentation. Commit checks inspect complete "
"staged documentation inputs and required configuration only. They neither "
"install tools over the network nor automatically stage fixes."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:44
msgid "翻译当前正文"
msgstr "Translate the current body"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:46
msgid ""
"`source_language` 表示 canonical 正文语言，不是读者选择的站点语言。相反语言采用 "
"`docs/locale/<language>/LC_MESSAGES/<docname>.po`；同语言使用原文。代码符号、TOML 键、 "
"状态、单位和原始证据值保持不变，不在译文中改变义务强度或借用结束条件。"
msgstr ""
"`source_language` is the canonical body language, not the site language "
"selected by the reader. The other language uses "
"`docs/locale/<language>/LC_MESSAGES/<docname>.po`; the same language uses "
"the source body. Keep code symbols, TOML keys, states, units and original "
"evidence values unchanged. Translation must not change obligation strength "
"or borrow-ending conditions."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:50
msgid ""
"从锁定工具本次实际提取的 POT 审查消息，不手写第二份消息清单。PO header 记录 `Language`、UTF-8、`X-Nexus-"
"Source-SHA256` 和独立语义审查后的 `X-Nexus-Reviewed: true`。每个实际 msgid 恰好出现一次、译文非空、无 "
"fuzzy，消息 集合与源摘要同时匹配。include 的 README 变化也属于输入，不能只改 header 装成新译文。"
msgstr ""
"Review messages from POT files actually extracted by the pinned tools for "
"this run; do not handwrite a second message list. PO headers record "
"`Language`, UTF-8, `X-Nexus-Source-SHA256` and, after independent semantic "
"review, `X-Nexus-Reviewed: true`. Each actual msgid appears exactly once, "
"with a nonempty translation and no fuzzy flag. Both message sets and source "
"digests must match. Changes to included READMEs are also inputs; changing "
"only a header does not produce a new translation."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:55
msgid ""
"当前术语见{download}`术语表 <../locale/terminology.csv>`。banner 区分 "
"original、reviewed、 stale、missing；预览回退到原文时保留真实语言，旧 MO 不维持已撤销的审查状态。"
msgstr ""
"Current terms are in the {download}`terminology table "
"<../locale/terminology.csv>`. The banner distinguishes original, reviewed, "
"stale and missing states. A preview fallback retains its actual language; "
"old MO files do not preserve revoked review status."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:58
msgid "完整验证"
msgstr "Complete validation"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:68
msgid ""
"verify 要求当前消息、公开 API、链接、图和两语言完整。按字节身份验证的阶段输入及 产物可复用，成功报告不能缓存为新验收。读取本次退出码与 "
"`documentation-build.json`；旧 HTML 不挽救当前失败。"
msgstr ""
"Verify requires complete current messages, public API, links, diagrams and "
"both languages. Stage inputs and artifacts verified by byte identity may be "
"reused; success reports cannot be cached as new acceptance. Read the current"
" exit code and `documentation-build.json`. Old HTML does not rescue a "
"current failure."

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/documentation.md:72
msgid ""
"审查正文语义、示例和译文后，更新导航与删除入口的当前引用。文档来源、描述的源码、 已验证软件和实际硬件记录分别保持身份；本地 HTML 构建不代表部署或"
" MCU 验收。"
msgstr ""
"After reviewing body semantics, examples and translations, update navigation"
" and current references to removed entry points. Documentation source, the "
"described source code, validated software and actual hardware records retain"
" separate identities. A local HTML build does not establish deployment or "
"MCU acceptance."
